section(class='community-split')
	div(class='main-container community-split__shell')
		div(class='container community-split__container community-split__inner')
			div(class='community-split__layout')
				div(class='community-split__media')
					img(class='community-split__image' src='./assets/img2.jpg' alt='' width='720' height='560' loading='lazy')

				div(class='community-split__content')
					h2(class='community-split__title') Más que productos, una comunidad.
					p(class='community-split__text') Te acompañamos con guías, recomendaciones, lanzamientos y contenido pensado para ayudarte a sentirte mejor, todos los días.

					div(class='community-split__cta')
						img(class='community-split__deco' src='./assets/img3.jpg' alt='' width='80' height='120' loading='lazy' aria-hidden='true')
						p(class='community-split__cta-title') Sumate a la comunidad Recupé Plus.
						form(class='community-split__form' action='#' method='post')
							label(class='community-split__sr-only' for='communitySplitEmail') Tu correo electrónico
							div(class='community-split__field')
								input(class='community-split__input' id='communitySplitEmail' type='email' name='email' placeholder='Tu correo electrónico' autocomplete='email' required)
								button(class='community-split__submit' type='submit') Quiero sumarme
